  "title": "Beverly S Probable NDE 6775",
  "date": "September 1958",
  "content": "It felt as if I had passed out while lying in bed. I then had a sensation of being lifted up into the sky. The next thing I saw was a man with shoulder length hair dressed in a white robe. Our eyes met and we communicated to one another through our thoughts. During this encounter, I experienced such joy and elation, unlike any I had ever had before or since. We were in the clouds the entire time. Then, he conveyed the message that I had to go. I longed to stay there with this individual. In the next instant, I felt as if I were falling. The next thing I remember was this feeling of being pushed into my bed. I was jolted awake and conscious. I felt badly that I was back in my bed and wanted to return to that place and stay there with this individual.",
